{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"gleam","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Gleam","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Gleam (.gleam).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"gleam","name":"Gleam","extensions":[".gleam"],"grammar":"grammars/gleam.json","lineComment":"//"}],"snippets":[{"language":"Gleam","path":"snippets/gleam.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/gleam.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\|>|->|<-|\\\\.\\\\.\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:implement|delegate|assert|derive|import|opaque|const|macro|panic|auto|case|echo|else|test|todo|type|let|pub|use|as|fn|if)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:False|True|Nil)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:BitArray|String|Result|Option|Float|Bool|List|Dict|Int|Nil)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:string\\\\.append|list\\\\.filter|io\\\\.println|result\\\\.try|list\\\\.fold|io\\\\.debug|list\\\\.map)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/gleam.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Main\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"main\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"import gleam/io\",\n      \"\",\n      \"pub fn main() {\",\n      \"  io.println(\\\"${1:Hello}\\\")\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"The main function\"\n  },\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fn\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"pub fn ${1:name}(${2:x}: ${3:Int}) -> ${4:Int} {\",\n      \"  $0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A public function\"\n  },\n  \"Case\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"case\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"case ${1:value} {\",\n      \"  ${2:pattern} -> $0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A case expression\"\n  },\n  \"Custom type\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"type\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"pub type ${1:Name} {\",\n      \"  ${2:Variant}(${3:field}: ${4:String})\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A custom type\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Gleam\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Gleam.\n\n## Files\n\n`.gleam`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `main` | The main function |\n| `fn` | A public function |\n| `case` | A case expression |\n| `type` | A custom type |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}